<tr>
<td>
<p>The AACSB-accredited Master of Accountancy (MACC) program, from WSU's Barton School, combines an in-depth study of accountancy with broad exposure to all aspects of business and management &mdash; equipping you with the skills and knowledge you'll need for career advancement, or a career switch, in the public or private sector.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3 class="heading4">Learn how accountancy is the right fit for you.</h3>
<table class="ou-snippet-generic-button-collection"><caption>Button Collection</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-select-list="buttons">landing-panel__buttons button-collection--accent-first</td>
<td><a class="button" href="https://slate.wichita.edu/register/graduateschool">Request Info </a> <a class="button" href="https://my.wsu-info.org/apply-get-started">Start Your Application</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
<td>&nbsp;
